Author: Kanghyun Lee, LMU Munich (bachelor thesis, 2026).

1. Scripts written for this study
   code/scripts/**, reproduce.py, make_archive.sh
   Licensed under the MIT License (text below).

2. Documentation and result data produced by this study
   README.md, results/data/**, results/raw-evidence/**
